 "notes": [
  "Posted 2 June 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Byline 'Artemis \".\" Entreri' is a fictional character's name (R. A. Salvatore's assassin) with handle '.', so he is credited as plain text with no player page, matching decks 16724 and 16887 by the same poster.",
  "Starting cards as given in the strategy and marked in the list: Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed, Heading For The Medical Frigate ('(SI)'), Strike Planning, Squadron Assignments and Insurrection ('(SE)'), Endor and Endor: Rebel Landing Site; all count toward the 60. Three Effects start and none is named as the starting Effect, so none is set.",
  "'(SE)' read as 'starting Effect' (as in this poster's other decks), not Special Edition, so Strike Planning, Squadron Assignments and Insurrection are the printed cards, not the (V) pages.",
  "Posted 'Rebel Strike Team/Garrison Deployed' dested Rebel Strike Team / Garrison Destroyed; 'The Menace Fades' Menace Fades; 'Take the Iniative' Take The Initiative; 'Out of Commission/ Transmission Terminated' Out Of Commission & Transmission Terminated; 'Gold Squadron One' Gold Squadron 1.",
  "Posted 'Luke w/ Saber' dested Luke With Lightsaber (the strategy calls him 'EPP Luke'); 'Obi w/ Saber' Obi-Wan With Lightsaber; 'Endor' the Light Endor system (Endor set).",
  "The post says the deck went 2-0 in a trial run (+39 differential); no named event. Total is 60 as published."
